{"title":"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 39","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the perimeter of a rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and its diagonal is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the difference between the length and width of the rectangle is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/0/fa05579eb8b7bf372c7067ce3969a78e17977011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac {\\sqrt {8d^2 - p^2}}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac {\\sqrt {8d^2 + p^2}}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{6d^2-p^2}}{2}\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac {\\sqrt {6d^2 + p^2}}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac {8d^2 - p^2}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"419\" height=\"81\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/a/53a2bf6f020d5e87abad067daf550f65299d40e4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H; A=(0,0); B=(10,0); C=(10,5); D=(0,5); E=(5,5.5); F=(5,-0.5); G=(-0.5,2.75); H=(10.5,2.75); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle); draw (B--D); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(-0.5,5),N);  label(&quot;$x$&quot;,E); label(&quot;$x$&quot;,F); label(&quot;$y$&quot;,G); label(&quot;$y$&quot;,H); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"148\" />\nLet the sides of the rectangle be x and y. WLOG, assume x&gt;y. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/337a3dddb5b86489ab8b567732d223905afabfbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+2y=p \\Rightarrow x+y=\\frac{p}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"200\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p>By pythagorean theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/7/487fef143bc6bbe5c4ba2a57dd4eef7b0d2f1cc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + y^2 =d^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/3/6a352ffca25b22cee5e201d15e3ffb986a7bf60b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=\\frac{p}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"78\" height=\"33\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/6/0264d3c315f9af7f504d13399b1b82e18f6481c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)^2=\\frac{p^2}{4} \\Rightarrow x^2+2xy+y^2=\\frac{p^2}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"288\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>Rearranging to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/a/abaf1f4bdf803c0f6f809aef04357676a307fcee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"17\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/5/e45261d0a9a0b13bbfcb237fddc93fcdb25020ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2xy = \\frac{p^2}{4}-d^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>Rearranging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/f/69ff44ae5c298b55c12f05a5d95814d3ea913353.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"19\" /> in terms of the defined variables becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/c/96cfc87413af1585f6c68bc0b397f3555763af9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)^2 = d^2 - (\\frac{p^2}{4}-d^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"199\" height=\"39\" />. \n</p><p>In order to get (x-y), we have to take the square root of the expression and simplify. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/3/193e47a2a32f7cb76b71842276fd6d0600462088.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)=\\sqrt{2d^2-\\frac{p^2}{4}} \\Rightarrow (x-y)=\\sqrt{\\frac{8d^2-p^2}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"362\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/3/843622567e12d686e4e2f94ddfcb444e8ecde0d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/e/c3eea48bf71d7ecfc46ac73de350f27bff57406a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)=\\frac{\\sqrt{8d^2+p^2}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"162\" height=\"39\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/3/843622567e12d686e4e2f94ddfcb444e8ecde0d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"9\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME\" title=\"1952 AHSME\">1952 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1952 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1952\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">Problem 40</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" ti